---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import AiSubnav from '../../components/AiSubnav.astro';
import AiDisclaimer from '../../components/AiDisclaimer.astro';

const description =
  'A practical case study in connected small-business systems for enrollment, scheduling, communication, payments, and bookkeeping.';
---

<Base title="Italian School of San Diego case study" description={description} canonical="/ai/italian-school.html">
  <div class="ai-page">
    <div class="ai-subhero">
      <p class="ai-kicker">Case study</p>
      <h1 class="post-title">Italian School of San Diego</h1>
      <p>
        A small education business has many connected workflows: students, families, teachers,
        schedules, payments, documents, and regulatory records. Andrea uses that direct operating
        experience to design practical automation.
      </p>
    </div>
    <AiSubnav />
    <section class="ai-section">
      <h2>One business, connected systems</h2>
      <ul class="ai-checks">
        <li>Enrollment records connected to the correct class and communication workflow</li>
        <li>Calendars aligned with schedules, locations, teachers, and students</li>
        <li>Payment status connected to receipts and follow-up tasks</li>
        <li>Employee hours prepared from approved calendar and operational records</li>
        <li>Customer inquiries researched before a response is drafted</li>
        <li>Transactions matched with receipts and supporting documents</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        The useful lesson is not a particular software product. It is the operating model: define an
        authoritative source, automate repeatable preparation, keep a visible record, and require
        human approval before consequential actions.
      </p>
      <div class="ai-policy">
        <p>
          The same controls apply across the system. Calculations and drafts can run automatically.
          Sending, submitting, scheduling, changing records, and initiating payments wait for
          approval from a responsible person.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="ai-actions">
        <a class="ai-button" href="https://zonca.secureform.dev/contact">Discuss a similar business process</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <AiDisclaimer />
  </div>
</Base>
